    {
      "id": "5E40000000000007",
      "title": "Cool the Cutting Head",
      "icon": {
        "id": "revoextraction:steel_drill_controller",
        "count": 1
      },
      "x": 9.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "shape": "circle",
      "dependencies": [
        "5E40000000000006"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Fill the side tank BEFORE starting. It stores 8000 mB of water and accepts buckets or fluid pipes on any face.",
        "The drill consumes 100 mB per 600 rotational work, spread over its cycle. Minecraft water renders inside the glass tank and falls as it empties. Working jets use the vanilla dripping-water particles.",
        "Connect an MI water pump or Create pump network for a steady supply. Missing coolant prevents production and causes seizure after five seconds of dry running.",
        "Every 100 mB of water consumed becomes 100 mB of sediment-laden water in the rear output. Route this fluid onward; full output pauses drilling without heating, damage or coolant loss."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E40000000001070",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": []
    },
    {
      "id": "5E40000000000008",
      "title": "Prepare for Maintenance",
      "icon": {
        "id": "revoextraction:drill_repair_kit",
        "count": 1
      },
      "x": 9.0,
      "y": -2.0,
      "shape": "circle",
      "dependencies": [
        "5E40000000000002"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Keep a repair kit nearby. If the Steel Drill seizes, its output is preserved.",
        "Stop the Create shaft, rebuild any missing frame parts, add at least 100 mB water, then right-click any part with the kit. One kit is consumed only after a successful repair.",
        "Breaking and replacing the controller preserves dry-running damage; it does not repair the machine.",
        "Craft a Cow egg, use it to craft a Cow spawner, then insert that spawner into the wooden Mob Harvester controller for leather and raw beef. One cycle produces one leather; a kit needs two. No diamond-gated machine or wild animal is required."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E40000000001080",
          "type": "item",
          "item": {
            "id": "revoextraction:drill_repair_kit",
            "count": 1
