      "description": [
        "Steel extraction supplies lead and antimony for LV batteries, Mineral Sludge for quartz and one Gem Sludge every 32 outputs.",
        "Wash Gem Sludge with a water-backed Create Encased Fan for diamonds and lapis, or craft four sludge into one guaranteed emerald. Keep your steam ore processing running."
      ],
