    },
    {
      "id": "5E4000000000000C",
      "title": "Iron Electric Greenhouse",
      "icon": {
        "id": "revocultivation:iron_greenhouse",
        "count": 1
      },
      "x": 8.0,
      "y": 8.0,
      "shape": "diamond",
      "dependencies": [
        "5E20000000000014",
        "5E80000000000030"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Build a 5 x 5 x 3 Iron Greenhouse around a full 3 x 3 soil bed: 11 supports, 21 casings, 20 glass panels, 9 soil beds, controller, hatch, Iron Water Tank, Basic Power Converter and grow light. Leave the 3 x 3 middle chamber empty. EMI shows every layer. Assemble your Basic Power Converter in the MI Assembler after establishing LV steam power.",
        "Steel framing supports the connected glass borders and four thin white LED strips. Fit the tank left-centre and converter rear-right on the bottom layer. The hatch goes immediately in front of the converter on the right side. Face converter FE rearward so EU touches the hatch; keep FE to EU mode. The fitted enclosure appears when formed.",
        "Supply 8 EU/t to the hatch, or 80 FE/t to the converter with the default ratio. The greenhouse buffer stores 1600 EU; the converter stores no power.",
        "Nine native wheat/carrot/potato/beetroot models fill the bed, with real age stages. Each 10-second harvest uses 250 mB water. The attached 16000 mB tank accepts buckets/pipes and renders its real water level. Grow lights support day/night and indoor operation.",
        "Iron and Steel Drills produce rare Flux Dust: one every 128 completed cycles. Steel Mob Harvester Blaze mode supplies blaze rods. Steel Harvester Enderman mode supplies Ender Pearls for vanilla Eyes of Ender."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E400000000010C0",
          "type": "item",
          "item": {
            "id": "revocultivation:iron_greenhouse",
            "count": 1
          },
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [],
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "id": "5E4000000000000D",
      "title": "Steel Mob Harvester",
      "icon": {
        "id": "revogenetics:steel_mob_harvester",
        "count": 1
      },
      "x": 13.0,
      "y": 8.0,
      "shape": "diamond",
      "dependencies": [
        "5E40000000000002"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Build the 3 x 3 x 3 steel cage from twelve supports, seven casings, three barred panels, a collection grate, species filter, item hatch and steel controller. See EMI for layers and directions.",
        "The selected Zombie, Skeleton, Spider, Cow, Blaze, Slime, Enderman or Magma Cube remains an actual persistent machine-owned mob. It cannot despawn or escape. Insert a crafted mob-specific spawner into the controller to change species. Eggs and placed spawners cannot spawn mobs.",
        "The steel harvester produces the existing species drops every 240 seconds with a Standard Spawner or 60 seconds with a Reinforced Spawner. This is passive production. All drops must fit before a cycle completes; the hatch auto-ejects."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E400000000010D0",
