      },
      "x": 12.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "shape": "circle",
      "dependencies": [
        "5E40000000000006"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Craft the Steel Drill Sediment Output Hatch from a native MI Steel Fluid Output Hatch and four steel plates. Replace the rear-top centre casing. Point the output away from the drill; the hatch uses MI storage, locking, menu and fluid auto-extraction.",
        "The Steel Drill consumes and returns 100 mB per completed work cycle: water in, sediment-laden water out. Pipe the output into a tank. Its 8000 mB native hatch will halt the drill when full; work, coolant and damage then pause. Drain it to resume.",
        "This fluid is separate from item Mineral Sludge and Gem Sludge. Save it for the seawater route after LV. Wooden and Iron Drills remain uncooled."
      ],
